-- sends them, with the English name put in. 19 drop from our loot (for example Lumbering Ogre Axe, Spire of Hakkar, Crown of the
-- Ogre King). English names: 19 from Questie's classic item data (github.com/Questie/QuestieDB, GPLv3), 3 from wowsims/forever's
-- item data (github.com/wowsims/forever, MIT), and 1 translated by us from the Russian name: 287022 "Spaulders of Restraint"
-- (Наплеч сдерживания). 284086 Scarlet Executioner's Guise: its flavor text is our translation too. Both are listed in
-- tools/forever_cache/item_translations.tsv; replace them when the real English text turns up. Russian text in item_sparse_locale.
